msgid "Uninstall %s?"
msgstr "¿Desinstalar %s?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9152
msgid ""
"Keep saves: the game goes, its saves and settings stay, and installing it "
"again puts them back. Delete all: the game, its saves and settings go, "
"with no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Conservar datos: el juego se va, sus datos guardados y ajustes se quedan, "
"y al volver a instalarlo se restauran. Eliminar todo: el juego, sus datos "
"guardados y ajustes se van, sin copia de seguridad ni posibilidad de "
"deshacer."

